WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.414
Your next pipeline starts with a drag.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.706
Meet Duckpad.

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:07.260
An open-source workspace for people who

00:00:07.345 --> 00:00:08.706
work with data.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.357
Drop a step onto the canvas.

00:00:11.528 --> 00:00:14.421
Connect your sources. Shape the flow.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.438
Use simple controls to filter, join, and

00:00:18.523 --> 00:00:19.374
transform.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.864
Or open the SQL when you want to go deeper.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.234
Run with DuckDB, then explore the result

00:00:27.404 --> 00:00:28.851
right where you built it.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.383
Wonder where a number came from? Click it.

00:00:32.553 --> 00:00:34.936
Follow the calculation, all the way back to

00:00:35.021 --> 00:00:36.043
the source.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.319
Turn useful steps into reusable components.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.128
And keep your work versioned with Git.

00:00:44.298 --> 00:00:47.064
Review what changed. Explore a branch.

00:00:47.277 --> 00:00:49.660
Build with the confidence to go back.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.698
From the first connection to a result you

00:00:53.783 --> 00:00:54.889
can explain.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.574
Duckpad. See the flow. Trust the result.
